	"Description": "Google's on-device ML runtimes packaged for Unreal Engine: LiteRT-LM and LiteRT built and staged as linkable UE modules for Win64 / Android / macOS / iOS. Infrastructure, not a feature — it owns Bazel cross-compilation, per-platform binary staging, DLL load ordering and App Store framework packaging so consumer plugins can call the LiteRT C API directly.",
